# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local
.vite/

# Secrets — never commit real env files or key material.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
*.pem
*.key
key.properties

# Firebase / Google config. These are generated per-project by
# `flutterfire configure`; the committed placeholders are safe, real ones are not.
# Globs are deliberately loose — copies like "google-services (1).json" and
# "google-services .json" have slipped past narrower rules before.
*google-services*.json
*GoogleService-Info*.plist
**/firebase-service-account*.json
!**/firebase-service-account*.json.example
app/web/firebase-config.js

# Signing material
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.p8
*.mobileprovision

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
